{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "होनको पुथी ओलोल पे।", "target_text": "ಪುಸ್ತಕವನ್ನು ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "तिंगु पे।", "target_text": "ಎದ್ದು ನಿಲ್ಲಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "दुबुङ पे।", "target_text": "ಕುಳಿತುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "मोड़े नंबर ओल पे।", "target_text": "ಐದು ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಯನ್ನು ಬರೆಯಿರಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "चीज को लेखाए पे।", "target_text": "ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ಎಣಿಸಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "मुरुत नेल पे।", "target_text": "ಚಿತ್ರವನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "नेया कजी पड़ाव पे।", "target_text": "ಈ ಪದವನ್ನು ಓದಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "ऐंग तायोम कजी पे।", "target_text": "ನನ್ನ ನಂತರ ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿಸಿ.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "unr", "target_lang": "kn", "source_text": "ओकोए कजी दड़ेया?", "target_text": "ಯಾರು ಉತ್ತರಿಸಬಹುದು?", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
